Te: Hey Mister! I built that solar panel you asked for.
Mister: Good job, kiddo. I've been wanting to get my woodshop back and running. I think with the extra power we can start buiding some new improvements for this place.
Te: I'm glad I could help.
Mister: Keep it up and this place'll be ten times better than it was before. 
do QuestManager.start_quest("qst_mister01")
